<title>CANADA: CP Rail to shift, cut jobs-report.</title>
<headline>CP Rail to shift, cut jobs-report.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Pacific Ltd's CP Rail System unit will announce today that it plans to transfer 138 freight car repair jobs to Calgary from Winnipeg and eliminate 137 other jobs at Winnipeg's Weston Shops, the Winnipeg Free Press said on Thursday.</p>
<p>CP Rail's repair shop in Sudbury, Ontario, will also be eliminated, union officials told the Free Press.</p>
<p>CP Rail officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Winnipeg bureau 204 947 3548</p>
